      "notes": "You are an AI assistant for the TIP (Transition Intelligence Platform) application.\n\nYou help with government contract transitions and knowledge management.\n\nYou have access to tools for:\n- Searching documents (knowledge_search)\n- Listing available documents (list_documents)  \n- Getting full document text (get_file_contents)\n- Querying tabular data (query_document_rows)\n- Searching extracted facts (search_facts)\n\nAlways cite your sources and be helpful!"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TIP Agentic RAG\n\n### Test Instructions:\n1. Click 'Chat' button below\n2. Ask questions like:\n   - \"What documents are available?\"\n   - \"Tell me about transitions\"\n   - \"Search for contract information\"\n\n### Tools Available:\n- knowledge_search (vector search)\n- list_documents\n- get_file_contents\n- query_document_rows\n- search_facts\n\n### Models:\n- Chat: llama3.2:latest (Ollama)\n- Embeddings: nomic-embed-text:latest (Ollama)\n- Database: n8n_vectors (pgvector, 768d)\n- Current chunks: 36+\n\n### Architecture:\nQuery → Vector Search (nomic-embed-text) → Retrieved Chunks → Chat Model (llama3.2) → Formatted Answer",
